Package: bfcli
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: 0ct0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libasound2t64 | libasound2
Homepage: https://github.com/0ct0sec/GNDHOG
Description: Betaflight CLI terminal for M5Stack Cardputer Zero
 GNDHOG ZERO provides field diagnostics, a native framebuffer terminal,
 command history, completion, and configuration backup and restore over USB
 or UART.
